        "detailed_description": "<strong>A troop-clash strategy game. Choose your hero, command minions, crush enemy formations! Inspired by Heroes of Might &amp; Magic and Hero's Hour. Multiple races with national styles like Huaxia and France. Random maps = unique fun every game! Endless development &amp; combat!  </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846190/extras/541c866d832d082dd3ff468b1b33ab4f.avif?t=1754712211\" width=615 height=55 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846190/extras/595873d63303751e0ac5e0d59a49e535.poster.avif?t=1754712211\" width=614 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846190/extras/595873d63303751e0ac5e0d59a49e535.webm?t=1754712211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846190/extras/595873d63303751e0ac5e0d59a49e535.mp4?t=1754712211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Recruit legendary heroes with unique skills and distinct personalities! Each hero possesses powerful, unique abilities and growth paths. As the soul of your civilization, they lead the era, and their decisions profoundly impact the rise and fall of your empire.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846190/extras/4c5afcd0c20ec50e910e7c9891509d5c.avif?t=1754712211\" width=615 height=55 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846190/extras/3116deb95e5946f7384af16ada5514ac.poster.avif?t=1754712211\" width=614 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846190/extras/3116deb95e5946f7384af16ada5514ac.webm?t=1754712211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846190/extras/3116deb95e5946f7384af16ada5514ac.mp4?t=1754712211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Meticulously forge your extraordinary legion! From indestructible heavy infantry to agile arcane archers, and awe-inspiring siege behemoths, strategically combine hundreds of unique troop types. Activate powerful bonds and tactical synergies to overcome foes in ever-shifting battles.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846190/extras/eee702ea7d7d7cf8d849a607d5fe2be6.avif?t=1754712211\" width=615 height=55 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846190/extras/90481583f68672b9b9276c7ceb2c516e.poster.avif?t=1754712211\" width=614 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846190/extras/90481583f68672b9b9276c7ceb2c516e.webm?t=1754712211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846190/extras/90481583f68672b9b9276c7ceb2c516e.mp4?t=1754712211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Conquer every inch of land brimming with magic and secrets! Explore a vast, procedurally generated world. Encounter wonders holding ancient power, resource-rich strategic locations, and perilous magical terrains. Adapt your expansion strategy to the land and turn the environment into a battlefield advantage!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846190/extras/dae4d727b2cc2c792f2726dfd180fd4c.avif?t=1754712211\" width=615 he